## Validation contract

`LocalStateGateway` validates settings, supplier/category, invoice/line, payment, and daily-income envelopes, their references, and invoice payment balance/status consistency. ISO calendar dates and UTC timestamps are checked strictly, so impossible values such as `2026-02-30` recover to empty state with `needs_seed`; valid ISO values remain `ready`. `loadSeed()` and `restore()` clone deterministic fake data and write it atomically. M1.1 adds BrowserRouter, accessible local-demo Layout, semantic NavLinks, responsive mobile navigation, and only honest module placeholders. No CRUD, provider, overlays, confirmation dialog, route-heading focus management, domain type, Supabase, or auth behavior was added.

